<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID TO PLACE PLN 1.7 BLN WITH NBP.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID TO PLACE PLN 1.7 BLN WITH NBP.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks bid to place 1.7 billion zlotys, in nominal terms, at the National Bank of Poland's one- and five day reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction against a one billion zloty offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction should be available at about 1315 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
